argus (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of argus
  - Downloads latest YARA Forge rules from GitHub
  - Creates date-tagged folders for each release
  - Extracts only .yar files from packages
  - Supports INI-based configuration with conf.d overrides
  - Command-line argument -c for custom config directory

